[0.001, "o", "\u001b[2m  ⎿ 14 merged PRs across 6 repos\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.410, "o", "\u001b[0;37m● Reading the descriptions, not the diffs. A PR body here is the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;37m  as-built record, so the recap is mostly already written down.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.609, "o", "\u001b[38;5;110m● Bash\u001b[0m   gh pr view --json body,closingIssuesReferences \u001b[2m×14\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  ⎿ 2 issues closed · 1 filed\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.611, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m╭─\u001b[0m \u001b[1;36mWho's reading this recap?\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.310, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[0m \u001b[32m❯ 1. Teammates\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.311, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[0m   2. Manager or lead\r\n"]
[0.309, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[0m   3. Leadership\r\n"]
[0.309, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[0m   4. Just me\r\n"]
[0.309, "o", "\u001b[2m╰─\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.113, "o", "\u001b[2m  → \"do two — one for teammates, one for leadership\"\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m     format: Slack · detail: Standard\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.011, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1;36m  For teammates\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.510, "o", "  *Landfall: scraping is auditable, bugs are one-press reportable*\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  Two artifacts, two lifetimes: a provenance trace (which rule won\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  each field, no page content, kept) and evidence (the bundle plus a\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  page capture, 90-day expiry).\r\n"]
[1.209, "o", "  Its *first real use* found and fixed a live bug: FB items whose main\r\n  slot is a video render every photo as a 36px thumb, so the size rule\r\n  matched nothing.\r\n"]
[1.208, "o", "  \u001b[33mCaveat:\u001b[0m exercised end to end in a real browser, but the AWS\r\n  delivery half has not run against a deployed stack.\r\n"]
[1.808, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1;36m  For leadership\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.508, "o", "  *Bug reports from our listing scraper now reach the person who can\r\n  fix them.* A scraping bug used to be unreproducible by construction —\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  the page that caused it was gone by the time anyone noticed. Reports\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  now capture how the data was extracted and, for 90 days, the page it\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  came from. It found and fixed a real listing-import bug on its first\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  live use. The in-browser path is proven end to end; the cloud half is\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  built and reviewed but has not yet run against the deployed\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  environment.\r\n"]
[2.006, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[0;37m  Same 14 PRs, same caveats. Different altitude.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[5.007, "x", "0"]
